abstract: >-
  Straight-line distance from the 2020 Census population center of every U.S. county
  to the nearest medical detox, methadone (OTP), buprenorphine and residential
  addiction treatment program listed on SAMHSA FindTreatment.gov, with county
  population, income and program counts.
